{
  "title": "Become an AI Product Manager | Scaler",
  "bodyText": "Need Help? Talk to our Academic Advisors\nRequest a Call\nOnline PGP in Business and AI\nLogin\nAcademy\nDevOps\nData Science & ML\nAI & Machine Learning\nOnline PGP in Business & AI\nSchool of Technology\nSchool of Business\nNeovarsity\nMasterclass\nTopics\nLogin\nTake your career to the next level now!\nFull Name *\nEmail *\nPhone Number *\nOTP will be sent to this number for verification\n+91\nGraduation Year *\n\n\nSIGN UP\n\n\nBy creating an account I have read and agree to Scaler’s Terms and Privacy Policy\nAlready a member? LOG IN\nOR\nLog in using\nLogin\nor create your scaler account\nMobile Number *\n+91\nLogin\ncontinue using email\nOR\nLog in using\nRegister Now!\nStarts In\n02 d\n18 h\n37 m\n+91\n542 learners already registered\nREGISTER FOR FREE\nI wish to receive further updates and confirmation via Whatsapp\nBy continuing, you agree to Scaler's Terms and Privacy Policy\nBecome an AI Product Manager\nSTARTS ON:\nSeptember 8, 2026 7:30 PM (IST)\nENDS ON:\nSeptember 8, 2026 10:00 PM (IST)\nVENUE:\nOnline\nAbout this Masterclass\n\nThe AI PM role is becoming the default expectation at every product-led company. From early-stage startups to Google and Microsoft, teams are actively looking for PMs who can speak the language of AI: evaluate models, shape prompts, and build products that actually use intelligence well. \n\nIn this free masterclass by Amar Srivastava, CEO - Online Business, Scaler, on Tuesday, 8th September, 7:30 – 10:00 PM, you’ll learn exactly what it takes to become an AI PM that companies are looking to hire these days.\n\nRegister Now!\n\nWhat you will gain from this Masterclass\nThe AI PM salary premium — why companies pay 40-60% more\nSkills gap audit: what you already have vs. what's missing\nThe 3 AI concepts every PM must own (model evaluation, prompt design, RAG pipelines — explained simply)\nHow to write AI PRDs that engineers respect\nReframing your current PM experience as AI-relevant (you're closer than you think)\nHiring insider secrets: what Google, Microsoft, and top startups screen for\nHow PGP in Business and AI can help!\nMeet Amar Srivastava \nCEO Online Business, Scaler \nEx VP of Product - Doubtnut\nEx Board Member, Global Safety Council - Ola\nEx Project Lead - WHO\nEx Technology & Product Lead -  Ministry of Road Transport & Highways\nWho is this Event For?\n\nThis masterclass is especially suited for:\n\nProfessionals in product, operations, marketing, finance, strategy, and general management\nFounders and aspiring entrepreneurs navigating AI-led business change\nDecision-makers and future leaders, not just task executors\nProfessionals who see AI becoming part of their role and want clarity on how to use it effectively\n\nAbout Scaler's Online PGP in Business & AI\n\n\nScaler’s Online Post Graduate Program in Business & AI is designed for professionals who want to stay relevant and competitive in an AI-driven business environment.\n\nThe program combines:\n\nCore business fundamentals (strategy, marketing, finance, operations, leadership)\nApplied AI understanding tailored for business professionals\nReal-world case studies, hands-on projects, and industry-relevant applications\n\nRather than treating AI as a separate technical subject, the program integrates AI across business decision-making, helping professionals learn how to:\n\nUse AI to solve business problems\nMake better, faster, data-backed decisions\nLead teams and initiatives in AI-enabled organisations\n\nThis session offers a preview of the thinking, frameworks, and approach you will experience inside the Scaler PGP — helping you evaluate whether the program aligns with your career goals.\n\nUpcoming Events\nAI-First Leadership: How Tech Leaders Build 10X Teams\nSTARTS ON\nSep 10th ’26 | 7:30 PM – 9:30 PM\nRegister Now\nDownload our App\nScaler Offerings\nModern Software and AI Engineering\nModern Data Science and ML with Specialisation in AI\nDevOps, Cloud & AI Platform Engineering\nAdvanced AI & Machine Learning with Agentic AI\nScaler School of Technology\nScaler School of Business\nAI Engineering Advanced Certification by IIT- Roorkee CEC\nOnline PGP in Business and AI\nMasters in Advanced AI & Machine Learning\nMasters in Software Development\nResources\nEvents\nScaler Topics\nAlumini Review\nScaler Blogs\nCareers\nTerms of Use\nPrivacy Policy\nOther\nAbout Us\nContact Us\nBecome a Mentor\nBecome a TA\n©️ 2026 InterviewBit Technologies Pvt. Ltd. All Rights Reserved.",
